      "updated": 1786761454540,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Entities and Realtionship (3 M)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Entities and Realtionship (3 M)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hKb037iWx6pKQaFhnpTAN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9902.9093316228,
      "y": 8965.66307782437,
      "width": 477.4596862792969,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 210233935,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 1745278959,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761545306,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Scan your requirement pull out meaningful nouns",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Scan your requirement pull out meaningful nouns",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eE8ZadWhb0wnVcf-nxzIZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9916.241693581405,
      "y": 8971.996584629087,
      "width": 982.959228515625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 823528321,
      "version": 169,
      "versionNonce": 1227962593,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761592775,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nIdentifying Entities\n    - If something maintains changing state or enforces rules, it likely deserves to be its own entity.\n    - If it’s just information attached to something else, it’s probably just a field on another class.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nIdentifying Entities\n    - If something maintains changing state or enforces rules, it likely deserves to be its own entity.\n    - If it’s just information attached to something else, it’s probably just a field on another class.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7IIPXhj3M4kVjRrd8EbkB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9911.756940968282,
      "y": 9102.633415843275,
      "width": 634.6795654296875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 916759023,
      "version": 130,
      "versionNonce": 205298703,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761625223,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Define Relationships\n    - Which entitiy owns durable state ?\n    - How do they depend on each other ? (has-a, uses, contains)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Define Relationships\n    - Which entitiy owns durable state ?\n    - How do they depend on each other ? (has-a, uses, contains)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8ZWR_F32XJAQ6o9Uufc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9899.262613189927,
      "y": 8398.52217658799,
      "width": 1324.0390625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 506633359,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 231550703,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761706039,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Modern production systems favor composition over inheritance, simple state over deep hierarchies, and pragmatism over pattern worship",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Modern production systems favor composition over inheritance, simple state over deep hierarchies, and pragmatism over pattern worship",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y0DZtKxxcB3WAOeHyRbid",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9899.897487568902,
      "y": 9227.454797745995,
      "width": 249.3397979736328,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 477691681,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 253100815,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761748129,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3) Class Design (10- 15M)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3) Class Design (10- 15M)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lALa5p8Cxmrcn7aUmHWgu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9918.278370589165,
      "y": 9259.762285143586,
      "width": 804.779541015625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 761642177,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 202055855,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761757215,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For each entity, you'll answer two questions:\n    State - What does this class need to remember to enforce the requirements?\n    Behavior - What does this class need to do, in terms of operations or queries?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For each entity, you'll answer two questions:\n    State - What does this class need to remember to enforce the requirements?\n    Behavior - What does this class need to do, in terms of operations or queries?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VrShx6FQ93WmWwwsNr1Z8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9918.258054609028,
      "y": 9362.677961473937,
      "width": 857.2993774414062,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 744829281,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 1746822945,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786761924330,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deriving State from Requirement:\n    - Which parts of the requirements does this entity own?\n    - What information does it need to keep in memory to satisfy those responsibilities?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deriving State from Requirement:\n    - Which parts of the requirements does this entity own?\n    - What information does it need to keep in memory to satisfy those responsibilities?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
