    },
    {
      "id": "53sYlFUJL7yq0rxwf2147",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11959.828774779766,
      "y": 7936.8583570790815,
      "width": 364.5397033691406,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1847942415,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 1249013057,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762294141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "S - Single Responsibility Principle\nOCP - Open/Closed Principle\nLSP - Liskov Substitution Principle\nISP - Interface Segregation Principle\nDIP - Dependency Inversion Principle",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "S - Single Responsibility Principle\nOCP - Open/Closed Principle\nLSP - Liskov Substitution Principle\nISP - Interface Segregation Principle\nDIP - Dependency Inversion Principle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5yd3P3dPqnVLmujgQcITm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11623.497992549053,
      "y": 7884.771196769546,
      "width": 911.5070190429688,
      "height": 24.592124904768756,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 246073199,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1301459745,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762332283,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Design principles guide your decision making to create clean, extensible, and maintainable code",
      "fontSize": 19.673699923815004,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Design principles guide your decision making to create clean, extensible, and maintainable code",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dJhMrZpcBxDPzsC6W8jTE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11605.773050139003,
      "y": 8153.782446307086,
      "width": 966.4592895507812,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6462145,
      "version": 15,
      "versionNonce": 698716225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762390613,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KISS\n - When you're designing a class or choosing between patterns, pick the straightforward approach. \n   If you can solve the problem with a simple conditional instead of a strategy pattern, do tha",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KISS\n - When you're designing a class or choosing between patterns, pick the straightforward approach. \n   If you can solve the problem with a simple conditional instead of a strategy pattern, do tha",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KE2LKKZst8S25tPu8C50v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11612.218483742658,
      "y": 8254.3312105241,
      "width": 952.0394287109375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 857136815,
      "version": 16,
      "versionNonce": 1104216303,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762409304,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DRY\n - When you find yourself writing the same logic in multiple places, pull it into one place. \n    If three classes all validate email addresses the same way, create a shared validation method.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DRY\n - When you find yourself writing the same logic in multiple places, pull it into one place. \n    If three classes all validate email addresses the same way, create a shared validation method.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M0GjnOcd1w6QiTZ_Ve-9E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11622.531177508505,
      "y": 8360.03632162404,
      "width": 61.3399658203125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b60",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1141771553,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1635996751,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762432663,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "YAGNI",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "YAGNI",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "P9yyxpy_6I6yPpfYsuyD1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11623.709483339173,
      "y": 8394.141729278379,
      "width": 887.2794189453125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b61",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1974749153,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 1333947553,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762448403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- This principle doesn't mean \"never think ahead\" - it means don't build ahead. Design with \n  extension in mind, but only implement what's needed now.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- This principle doesn't mean \"never think ahead\" - it means don't build ahead. Design with \n  extension in mind, but only implement what's needed now.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nSvPcwW94INp6RoycUDtD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11622.923946118732,
      "y": 8475.308873229407,
      "width": 1259.4991455078125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b62",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1705690177,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 105958145,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762504525,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Separation of Concerns\n    - Different parts of your code should handle different responsibilities, and they shouldn't know about each other's internals. \n    - Your UI layer shouldn't contain business logic. \n    - Your business logic shouldn't know how data is stored. \n    - Your data access layer shouldn't format strings for display.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Separation of Concerns\n    - Different parts of your code should handle different responsibilities, and they shouldn't know about each other's internals. \n    - Your UI layer shouldn't contain business logic. \n    - Your business logic shouldn't know how data is stored. \n    - Your data access layer shouldn't format strings for display.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gHPEv8iXEeqOJPS5v65Ts",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11619.373922141716,
      "y": 8631.097017627748,
      "width": 154.5598907470703,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b63",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2133147297,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 317589089,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762540001,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Law of Demeter",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Law of Demeter",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GpDZTSKJc9SlLEo9ihNnY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11638.000218157276,
      "y": 8660.393527554359,
      "width": 1169.159423828125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b64",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 211793409,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1093251361,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786762561307,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Also called the principle of least knowledge. \nA method should only talk to its immediate friends, not reach through objects to access distant parts of the system. \nIf you see code like order.getCustomer().getAddress().getZipCode(), that's violating the Law of Demeter.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Also called the principle of least knowledge. \nA method should only talk to its immediate friends, not reach through objects to access distant parts of the system. \nIf you see code like order.getCustomer().getAddress().getZipCode(), that's violating the Law of Demeter.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MKlJAXYwgqg_LV2ItlpbG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11631.554784553628,
      "y": 8788.013112906734,
      "width": 363.0196838378906,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b67",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1899913025,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 2023870657,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786763704132,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "SOLID\n- SRP - Single Responsibility Principle\n    ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SOLID\n- SRP - Single Responsibility Principle\n    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6ibUaJ86JLrN2c6xzj7nB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11648.334903309338,
      "y": 8849.026304453415,
      "width": 1248.7336004606952,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b68",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1531446959,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1679481345,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786763717424,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A class should have one reason to change. If a class mixes multiple concerns, split them. This is the foundation of good class\ndesign.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A class should have one reason to change. If a class mixes multiple concerns, split them. This is the foundation of good class design.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sF9l2gVNSEvGATKhrURl4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11628.976611112168,
      "y": 8919.651023271372,
      "width": 1273.218994140625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b69",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1223774593,
      "version": 47,
      "versionNonce": 352592641,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767249831,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- OCP - Open Closed Principle\n   Classes should be open for extension but closed for modification. \n   You should be able to add new behavior without changing existing code. \n   This usually means using interfaces or abstract classes so you can add new implementations without touching the original code.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- OCP - Open Closed Principle\n   Classes should be open for extension but closed for modification. \n   You should be able to add new behavior without changing existing code. \n   This usually means using interfaces or abstract classes so you can add new implementations without touching the original code.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C2PS8Lov3yJ-LVQ2SPXzY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11632.843871274361,
      "y": 9047.119543773653,
      "width": 364.9197082519531,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 427267745,
      "version": 48,
      "versionNonce": 1423945921,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767273480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- LSP - Liskove Substitution Principle",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- LSP - Liskove Substitution Principle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "j_gJiLr-mSdpZSZwIHU3n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11653.43904583604,
      "y": 9080.232958912431,
      "width": 1274.93896484375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 204785729,
      "version": 42,
      "versionNonce": 545803905,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767314087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If your code uses a parent class or interface, it should be able to use any subclass without knowing which specific subclass it is. \nThe subclass can add new behavior, but it can't remove or break behavior that the parent promised",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If your code uses a parent class or interface, it should be able to use any subclass without knowing which specific subclass it is. \nThe subclass can add new behavior, but it can't remove or break behavior that the parent promised",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EwUJt6ZdAMArS9zaDEtr8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11629.183066407277,
      "y": 9150.175984502095,
      "width": 380.7596740722656,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 923729007,
      "version": 73,
      "versionNonce": 1109005743,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767375739,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- ISP - Interface Segregation Principle",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- ISP - Interface Segregation Principle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EywLgYDRB2nODXIQtmfI8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11654.969836316901,
      "y": 9185.630904817199,
      "width": 951.5794067382812,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6D",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1641488399,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 1131139553,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767391803,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prefer small, focused interfaces over large, general-purpose ones. \nDon't force classes to implement methods they don't need. \nIf a class only needs two methods from an interface with ten methods, that interface is too big",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prefer small, focused interfaces over large, general-purpose ones. \nDon't force classes to implement methods they don't need. \nIf a class only needs two methods from an interface with ten methods, that interface is too big",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0biBoBjzUEygJlUJtXQsE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11622.531177508507,
      "y": 9275.287893343038,
      "width": 377.3796691894531,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 362230145,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 2144295073,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767410075,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- DIP - Dependency Inversion Principle",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- DIP - Dependency Inversion Principle",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JTYqxF9-UufaYGdszGv7_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 11645.60381561159,
      "y": 9309.987489407717,
      "width": 1041.779296875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1268875297,
      "version": 34,
      "versionNonce": 1847346113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786767422349,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dependency Inversion states that your code should depend on abstractions, not concrete implementations",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dependency Inversion states that your code should depend on abstractions, not concrete implementations",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
